  "an5.177:1.1": "bhikkhave vaṇijjā upāsakena akaraṇīyā. ",
  "an5.177:1.2": "Katamā pañca? ",
  "an5.177:1.3": "Satthavaṇijjā, sattavaṇijjā, maṃsavaṇijjā, majjavaṇijjā, visavaṇijjā. ",
  "an5.177:1.4": "Imā kho bhikkhave pañca vaṇijjā upāsakena akaraṇiyā ",
  "an5.177:1.5": "ti. 1. "
}
